# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. An epoch observed while a scan runs must leave
# the result non-authoritative until the follow-up rebuild; the mutant marks it
# current regardless.
MODULE: RebuildFinishIgnoresDirty
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a rebuild invalidated while it scanned still publishes as current
PERTURBS: RebuildFinish

--- FIND
    /\ stale' = [stale EXCEPT ![s] = scanDirty[s]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the follow-up rebuild is skipped.
    /\ stale' = [stale EXCEPT ![s] = FALSE]
--- END
